<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-slack-substance-leak> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "Grep Slack for decision/design keywords, cross-reference with files. Semi-automated." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-slack-substance-leak> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-substance-persistent> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-slack-substance-leak> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "No decisions, designs, or specs live only in Slack. If you can't find it in a file, it wasn't properly captured. Audit: search Slack for decision language, verify file exists." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-slack-substance-leak> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "No Substance in Slack" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-slack-substance-leak> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-boundary-integrity> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "Parse bridge-marked messages for work-initiation language. Semi-automated." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-boundary-integrity> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#dec-017> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-boundary-integrity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Roles do not start new work or reprioritize without Jeff's directive (DEC-017). Audit: bridge responses checked for unauthorized work initiation." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-boundary-integrity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Boundary Integrity" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-boundary-integrity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-pm-bypass-rate> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "Board cards cross-referenced with product-manager/briefs/. Scriptable when jeff-tickets.md is retired." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-pm-bypass-rate> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-owner-not-router> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-pm-bypass-rate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What percentage of work comes Jeff-direct vs through Wren? Board cards with no Wren brief vs cards that trace to a Wren brief. Temporary: jeff-tickets.md until automated." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-pm-bypass-rate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PM Bypass Rate" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-pm-bypass-rate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-session-artifact-rate> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "git log --since/--until per session. Zero commits = gap. Scriptable." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-session-artifact-rate> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-artifacts-truth> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-session-artifact-rate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every session that produces direction results in at least one artifact (card, brief, decision, ADR, or commit). Zero commits = invisible session." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-session-artifact-rate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Session Artifact Rate" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-session-artifact-rate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-decision-capture> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "Grep Slack for DEC/ADR signals, match against files in decisions.md and adr/. Semi-automated." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-decision-capture> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-artifacts-truth> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-decision-capture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every Jeff directive appears in an artifact (DEC-*, ADR-*, decisions.md) within the same session. Audit: search #all-gathering for [DEC-*] signals, cross-reference decisions.md + adr/." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-decision-capture> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Decision Capture" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-decision-capture> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "Parse Slack timestamps. Filter by channel, measure delta between non-bridge and bridge-marked messages. Scriptable." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#kade> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#silas> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#wren> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Agent roles respond to directed messages within 30s (bridge) or 2min (hooks). Audit: Slack timestamps between message and response. Bridge marker distinguishes response types." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Response Latency" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-response-time> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-brief-chain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#auditMethod> "For each Done card: ls -lt <role>/briefs/ for matching date+topic files. Scriptable." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-brief-chain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-artifacts-truth> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-brief-chain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every shipped feature has a brief trail through the building value stream (Direction → Frame → Shape → Spec → Build). Audit: for each Done card, check role briefs/ for related files." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-brief-chain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brief Chain" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-brief-chain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
