<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-card-coverage> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#validates> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-owner-not-router> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-card-coverage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Every shipped feature traces to a board card. Audit: compare git log to board Done items. Commits without a card = uncarded work." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-card-coverage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Card Coverage" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ff-card-coverage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#FitnessFunction> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-substance-persistent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Briefs hold substance. Slack carries signals. Never put substance only in Slack." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-substance-persistent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Substance is persistent, signals are ephemeral" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-substance-persistent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Principle> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-self-healing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When a role starts after a gap, synchronization from artifacts should bring them current without Jeff recapping." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-self-healing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The system should be self-healing" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-self-healing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Principle> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-owner-not-router> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Jeff sets direction and intent. Roles maintain shared context with each other directly." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-owner-not-router> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jeff is the owner, not the router" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-owner-not-router> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Principle> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-artifacts-truth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "When Slack and a file disagree, the file wins. Slack is wind, files are ground." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-artifacts-truth> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Artifacts are the source of truth" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#principle-artifacts-truth> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Principle> .
