<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AutomationService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A service that runs automatically — hooks, polling, scheduled tasks." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AutomationService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Automation Service" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AutomationService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A platform component that provides self-service coordination infrastructure to the team." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Service> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Close> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Session end. Update activity.md, commit and push, post to #standup, run role-specific checks." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Close> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Close" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Close> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#SessionPhase> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Operate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "During session. Quick Slack scan every turn. Brief + signal + record when producing. Read + respond + log when consuming." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Operate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Operate" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Operate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#SessionPhase> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Synchronize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Session start. Pull repo, read CLAUDE.md + team-architecture.md, check briefs/, read Slack, scan activity.md." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Synchronize> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Synchronize" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Synchronize> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#SessionPhase> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#SessionPhase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A phase in the role session lifecycle. Every role, every session, same sequence." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#SessionPhase> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Session Phase" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#SessionPhase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Informational. Acknowledge when convenient." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P3" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Priority> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Important but not blocking. Respond within a session or two." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P2" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Priority> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Blocks someone's work. Respond this session." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P1" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#P1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Priority> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Urgency classification for signals and briefs." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Priority" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Priority> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Record> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Permanent log entry in activity.md. Captures that something significant happened." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Record> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Record" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Record> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Question> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Short, conversational, needs a short answer. Lives in Slack." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Question> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Question" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Question> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Signal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Short notification that context has changed. Lives in Slack. Ephemeral." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Signal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Signal" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Signal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Brief> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Structured document with substance. Lives in recipient's briefs/ directory. Source of truth." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Brief> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brief" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Brief> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Classification of team communication. Exactly four types per team-architecture.md." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Message Type" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#MessageType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Facilitating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One role helps another get better at something. Teaching, not doing." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Facilitating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Facilitating" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Facilitating> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#InteractionMode> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#XAsAService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Clear API contract, low friction. One role provides a service to another via defined interface (e.g., brief format)." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#XAsAService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "X-as-a-Service" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#XAsAService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#InteractionMode> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Collaboration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "High-bandwidth, temporary. Two roles working closely on a shared problem. Time-boxed." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Collaboration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Collaboration" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Collaboration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#InteractionMode> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#InteractionMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "How two roles work together. From Team Topologies: collaboration, x-as-a-service, facilitating." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#InteractionMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Interaction Mode" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#InteractionMode> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ComplicatedSubsystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specialist knowledge domain. Owns complexity so it doesn't leak into every decision." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ComplicatedSubsystem> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Complicated Subsystem" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#ComplicatedSubsystem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Platform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Self-service infrastructure that makes the team's work easier. Used by roles, not managed by them." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Platform> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Platform" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Platform> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Enabling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reduces cognitive load on stream-aligned roles. Provides guidance, reviews, structural integrity." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Enabling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Enabling" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Enabling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#StreamAligned> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Aligned to the value stream. Owns the flow of what gets built and shipped." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#StreamAligned> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Stream-Aligned" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#StreamAligned> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Classification from Team Topologies: stream-aligned, enabling, platform, complicated-subsystem." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Team Topology Type" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#TeamTopologyType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AgentRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Role> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AgentRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A role filled by an AI agent. Persistent across sessions via state files and memory." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AgentRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Agent Role" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#AgentRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#HumanRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Role> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#HumanRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A role filled by a human participant. Owns judgment, direction, and meaning." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#HumanRole> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Human Role" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#HumanRole> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specialized function within the team. Each role has defined capabilities, boundaries, and interaction modes. Inspired by Team Topologies team types." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Role" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/building#Role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
