<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileDependsOn> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#writeOwner> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#enrichment> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileDependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Domain> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileDependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#File> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileDependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Domain this file USES (as opposed to belongs-to / fileInDomain). Derived by function: enrichment detects call-sites / imports of a domain's surface (e.g. a chorus-log emit makes the file dependsOn chorus:spine). Multi-valued. The inbound set per domain = that domain's file-level blast-radius. #3017." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileDependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "file depends on" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileDependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileHasOwner> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#writeOwner> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#enrichment> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileHasOwner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Role> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileHasOwner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#File> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileHasOwner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Role responsible for the file. Derived: enrichment reads frontmatter / falls back to subdomain owner." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileHasOwner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "file has owner" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileHasOwner> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileInDomain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#writeOwner> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#enrichment> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileInDomain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#SubDomain> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileInDomain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#File> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileInDomain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Athena subdomain this file belongs to. Derived: enrichment maps the path against the subdomain registry." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileInDomain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "in domain" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileInDomain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#stale> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#writeOwner> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#crawler> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#stale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#stale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Hydratable> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#stale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Set true by deletes-reconciliation when the file's filesystem path no longer exists. NOT a remove from the graph — visibility-not-removal so consumers choose how to treat. Cleared if the file reappears." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#stale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "stale" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#stale> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
