<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileLastModified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileLastModified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#File> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileLastModified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Filesystem mtime at last crawl, ISO 8601." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileLastModified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "last modified" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileLastModified> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileSha> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#writeOwner> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#crawler> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#fileSha> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
