<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#bypassAudit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Boolean. true = bypass emits a spine event (auditable); false = bypass is silent (a debt to repay). Mirrors ADR-028 §schema-write hook bypass discipline." .
