<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#bypassEnvs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Env var names (comma-separated) that, when set, disable the check. Empty string = no bypass. Listing them in the graph forces them to be visible." .
