<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#rotationPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Free-text rotation cadence and trigger (e.g., '90d', 'on-leak', 'manual', 'launchd-restart')." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#rotationPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rotation policy" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#rotationPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
