<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#dctermsSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dcterms:source" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#dctermsSource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
