<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#specializes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Principle> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#specializes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Chorus-specific principle specializes a more general (permaculture) parent principle. The child inherits the parent's intent and applies it to team/tech context. Distinct from derivedFrom (practice/policy→principle); specializes is principle→principle. #2447." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#specializes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "specializes" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#specializes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
