<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#implementedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A skill or gate is implemented in a file (path relative to chorus repo root, e.g., platform/services/chorus-hooks/src/gates/demo_gate.rs). Concrete Loom→Werk trace. Range is xsd:string today; future: resource pointing at a code node. #2348." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#implementedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "implemented in" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#implementedIn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#authorizedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:B384a2a750dd988a07431b8a929cd218e .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#authorizedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:B1fc18dbb7606f87ce3bb7990141e58e2 .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#authorizedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A skill or gate is authorized by a role or practice. Inverse of hasSkill / hasGate. Makes orphan queries cheap: Skill or Gate without authorizedBy = orphan. #2348." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#authorizedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "authorized by" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#authorizedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hasGate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Gate> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hasGate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:Bda62b109604420835b5d811f197c7f20 .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hasGate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A role or practice has a gate it runs or enforces. Role hasGate = gate the role is authorized to evaluate; Practice hasGate = gate that enforces the practice's invariant. #2348." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hasGate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has gate" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#hasGate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
