<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#abstract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "True on a principle with no practice expressing it — aspirational claim the team does not enact." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#abstract> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "abstract" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#abstract> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
