<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#dependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sub-product or sub-domain depends on another for its function — if the target is unavailable or broken, the source is degraded. Distinct from chorus:consumes (read-only data flow). Dependency implies lifecycle coupling." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#dependsOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "depends on" .
