<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#API> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A persistent perspective within Chorus. Each role has context (CLAUDE.md, state files, briefs) that shapes how it thinks. Same model, different lens." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Role" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Role> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A persistent perspective — human or agent. Owns services, domains, and gates." .
