<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Role> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Quality gate between vertebrae. Failures bounce work backward." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gate" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
