<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A quality gate that protects a domain or stage transition. Enforced by hooks (Rust binary). Pass/Fail/Override." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gate" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Domain> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Domain> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Domain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A bounded context within Gathering — a coherent area of data and functionality. Each domain has collection classes (jb:), services (borg:), and gates (chorus:) that govern it." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Domain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Domain" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Domain> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Service> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <urn:borg:ontology/Environment> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Service> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#Service> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A running service instance. Bridges borg:Environment (engine instance on a host) and chorus:Service (runtime component in coordination). The engine → environment → resource hierarchy lives in borg.ttl." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Service> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Service" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/framework#Service> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:borg:ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.0" .
<urn:borg:ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "v0.1.0: initial release. Engine, Environment, Resource classes. Monitor and AlertRule for coverage scoring. Seven domains registered." .
<urn:borg:ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-04-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<urn:borg:ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The system sees itself. Engine → Environment → Resource hierarchy for infrastructure reflection. Provider-agnostic model with herald-based discovery." .
<urn:borg:ontology/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Borg — Reflection Ontology" .
<urn:borg:ontology/> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.3.0" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "v0.3.0: merges product ontology, adds Shaping vertebra, domain subtypes, service model. Single namespace (https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#), single truth." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-04-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-02-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Unified model of human+AI team coordination: roles, tools, spine, artifacts, handoffs, gates, trust, products, domains, services, value streams." .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Chorus — Canonical Model" .
<https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
